            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "APPROVED_TXN_OUTPUT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771019369118",
          "id": "1767426574889",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767426574890_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### 1) Generate recordWidget\n\nGenerate a readonly recordWidget with id as concatenation of: \"scheduleShiftId_\", {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.ScheduleShiftId }}\n\n<Overview> - Generate ONE sentence description of the shift  from {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output}} by considering ShiftName, ShiftTypeMeaning, ShiftCategory, ShiftStartTime, ShiftEndTime, JobProfileName and CompetencyName(if exists).\n\nand fields as\n\nCompute WorkDuration in hours and minutes and show in \"x h  y m\" format.\n\nfields: [\n {\n    id: \"ShiftDate\",\n    label: \"Shift Date\",\n    value: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.ReferenceDate}} ,\n    type: \"text\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"ShiftName\",\n    label: \"Shift\",\n    value: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.ShiftName}} ,\n    type: \"text\"\n  },\n{\n    id: \"WorkDuration\",\n    label: \"Work Duration\",\n    value: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.WorkDuration}} ,\n    type: \"text\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"ShiftTypeMeaning\",\n    label: \"Shift Type\",\n    value: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.ShiftTypeMeaning}} ,\n    type: \"text\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"ShiftCategory\",\n    label: \"Shift Category\",\n    value: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.ShiftCategory}} ,\n    type: \"text\"\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"JobProfileName\",\n    label: \"Job\",\n    value: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.JobProfileName}} ,\n    type: \"text\"\n  }\n]\n\nGenerate ONE sentence description of the importance of this shift coverage and recommended workers to fill this shift.\n\nGenerate a  editable recordWidget with id as concatenation of: \"ScheduleShiftId_\", {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.ScheduleShiftId }},\"_ScheduleId_\", {{$context.$nodes.GET_SHIFT_DETAILS.$output.ScheduleId }},\"_TransactionId_\", {{$context.$nodes.GET_TRANSACTION_DETAILS.$input.pTransactionId}}\n\nand fields as\n\nfields: [\n {\n    id: \"ReassignTo\",\n    label: \"Reassign To\",\n    options: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_WORKER_LIST_FOR_REASSIGNMENT.$output.result}} ,\n    type: \"select\"\n  }\n]\n\n** DISPLAY RULES FOR ReassignTo field **\n1.  Include only PersonName, FTEDuration, WorkDuration, Utilization % (WorkDuration/FTEDuration) attributes in the ReassignTo field. \n2. Add \"Person Name\", \"Contracted\" for FTEDuration, \"Scheduled\" for WorkDuration, \"Utilization\" as column headers. \n3. Display FTEDuration and WorkDuration in 'x h y m' format. Example: If FTEDuration is 2550 then display as '42h 30m' and WorkDuration is 960, then display as '16h'\n\nPlease set value of above field as concatenation of:  \"PersonId_\",{{ $context.$nodes.BUILD_WORKER_LIST_FOR_REASSIGNMENT.$output.result.PersonId }},  \"_AssignmentId_\",  {{ $context.$nodes.BUILD_WORKER_LIST_FOR_REASSIGNMENT.$output.result.AssignmentId }} from the selected worker's option.\n\nDo not default any value for the ReassignTo field.\n\nHard Constraints:\nDisplay all date fields in {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERPREFERENCES.$output.items[0].DateFormat}}  format.\nDo not include any additional fields.\nDo not omit any of the listed fields.\nDo not change field names, labels, or types.\nDo not add comments, explanations, or formatting outside this structure."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
